# Astra-Axiom Sentinel

### Multi-Market Intelligence HUD for Android

> ⚠️ **Data & Privacy Disclaimer:** Sentinel is a standalone application. **No registration, user account, login, or personal profile is required. Sentinel does not track users or collect user data.** The application operates independently on each user's Android device and retrieves market information directly from public data streams. No user account or Sentinel cloud service is required for operation.

Astra-Axiom Sentinel is a professional-grade Android market-intelligence application built to provide high-precision snapshots of global market structure. It moves beyond basic price tracking to provide deep technical confluence and structural validation.

Sentinel is designed for **Market Observation and Structural Awareness**: it pulls real-time data, processes it through a vectorized intelligence engine, and presents a compact "HUD" (Heads-Up Display) of actionable technical metrics.

